urface":"韓公子長","kind":"person","person_id":"ei3_w5i_7ai","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0225","start":225,"end":230,"surface":"孟嘗君薛文","kind":"person","person_id":"7pl_s0g_rkh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0234","start":234,"end":235,"surface":"奐","kind":"person","person_id":"u4n_65h_uqv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0245","start":245,"end":247,"surface":"景快","kind":"person","person_id":"4wh_yve_8ul","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0251","start":251,"end":254,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0262","start":262,"end":264,"surface":"薛文","kind":"person","person_id":"7pl_s0g_rkh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0269","start":269,"end":271,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"p41_n3z_dlq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0320","start":320,"end":323,"surface":"楚懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0345","start":345,"end":347,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"p41_n3z_dlq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m069-0349","start":349,"end":353,"surface":"穰侯魏冉","kind":"person","person_id":"r2f_mtq_05s","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p002","text":"秦武王卒，無子，立其弟為昭王。昭王母故號為羋八子，及昭王即位，羋八子號為宣太后。宣太后非武王母。武王母號曰惠文后，先武王死。宣太后二弟：其異父長弟曰穰侯，姓魏氏，名冉；同父弟曰羋戎，為華陽君。而昭王同母弟曰高陵君、涇陽君。而魏冉最賢，自惠王、武王時任職用事。武王卒，諸弟爭立，唯魏冉力為能立昭王。昭王即位，以冉為將軍，衛咸陽。誅季君之亂，而逐武王后出之魏，昭王諸兄弟不善者皆滅之，威振秦國。昭王少，宣太后自治，任魏冉為政。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m002-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"秦武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAA